Movement: <r>ead [note] 
          <h>eads
          <g>o to [note] (resets comment chain)
          <n>ext command (from the prompt) (<return> is the same as 'n')
          <d>isplay [note](this note, and it's comments)
          <H>elp
          
Toggles:  <Q>uick read
          <l>inear mode
          
Actions:  <R>eply [note]
          <N>ew
          <D>elete {note}
          <Z>ap {note} (And all it's comments) (resets comment chain)
          <L>ock [note]
          <U>nlock [note]
          <E>dit [note]
          <S>kip all comments to this note (resets comment chain)
          <m>ark ALL notes on the board as unread (resets comment chain)
          <M>ark ALL notes on the board as read (resets comment chain)
          <q>uit the board
As always, you can do '!command' to execute a normal
MUD-Comamnd (Like !tell, !say etc.)

